{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub032_youngf_01",
      "hash": "fe033ea1b308fe8f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 0]"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub032_youngf_02",
      "hash": "fe033fa1b3090042",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我偶爾會去深灰市買東西。\\c\\n可是常青森林的路\\n實在太迂迴曲折了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub032_oldm_01",
      "hash": "1978755f4e6ce301",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub032_oldm_02",
      "hash": "1978725f4e6cdde8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "原來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳在收集寶可夢圖鑑？\\n那我來給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一些建議吧！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳最好到友好商店\\n多買一些精靈球！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub032_musashi_01",
      "hash": "9768d2491369333f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「幹什麼！不行不行！\\n現在這裡禁止通行！\\c\\n我正在執行重要的把風任務呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub032_musashi_02",
      "hash": "9768d349136934f2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「就說這裡\\n禁止通行了！\\c\\n小孩子要打發時間，\\n就去幫爸媽跑腿做家事去！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub032_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "98c6fe975db79e1d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「這個小鬼頭是怎麼回事？\\n……去去！給我滾一邊去！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub032_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "98c6fb975db79904",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「雖說是任務，\\n可是把風好無聊啊。\\c\\n真想到友好商店偷個懶……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub032_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "0edc7c7055db0f77",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喵喵「喵～"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_oyaji4_01_p03_field_t002",
      "hash": "85a5a580612c233f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
